TI  - Black pigment on EBUS-TBNA sampling: A case of malignant melanoma.
PG  - e01398
LID - 10.1002/rcr2.1398 [doi]
LID - e01398
AB  - The visualization of black pigment during EBUS-TBNA suggests a relapse of 
      melanoma. This case highlights the value of EBUS-TBNA in diagnosing metastatic 
      melanoma, particularly when the macroscopic appearance of the aspirate suggests 
      the diagnosis.
