TI  - Successful Diagnosis of Epithelial Thymic Cancer Case Using EBUS-TBNA.
PG  - 23247096221090791
LID - 10.1177/23247096221090791 [doi]
LID - 23247096221090791
AB  - Mediastinal masses are relatively uncommon. Surgical approach is often needed to 
      diagnose mediastinal masses. Using endobronchial ultrasound transbronchial needle 
      aspiration (EBUS-TBNA) toward approaching a mediastinal mass has yet to be 
      established. Here, we present a case of successful diagnosis of thymic cancer 
      with the use of EBUS-TBNA.
