TI  - Echoendoscopic appearance of mediastinal metastasis from papillary renal 
      carcinoma.
PG  - 3631-3633
LID - 10.1111/1759-7714.13704 [doi]
AB  - Endobronchial ultrasound-guided transbronchial needle aspiration (EBUS-TBNA) is 
      being increasingly used in the diagnostic workup of mediastinal diseases. Here, 
      we report a patient with cystic lesions located in the mediastinum, the sampling 
      of which facilitated the diagnosis of renal neoplasm. This paper confirms the 
      usefulness and safety of EBUS/TBNA on cystic lesions and describes a rare 
      presentation of intrathoracic metastases from carcinoma of the kidney.
