LID - 10.1016/j.dld.2009.07.014 [doi]
AB  - This review deals with the combined approach of endoscopic ultrasound and 
      endobronchial ultrasound for lung cancer staging. The review provides an overview 
      for the gastroenterologist who performs endosonography with regard to the current 
      evidence supporting the use of endoscopic ultrasound and endobronchial ultrasound 
