TI  - A case report of loss of thyroid transcription factor 1 expression in lung 
      adenocarcinoma EBUS FNA.
PG  - E172-E175
LID - 10.1002/dc.25333 [doi]
AB  - We present a case report of a 76-year-old male with a histologically confirmed 
      KRAS mutated, thyroid transcription factor 1 (TTF1) positive, grade 1, mucinous 
      adenocarcinoma with cytologically difficult to interpret lymph node metastasis 
      showing loss of TTF1 expression and overlapping features with goblet cell 
      hyperplasia. The case highlights the importance of molecular testing in aiding 
      diagnosis and guiding treatment of non-small cell lung carcinomas (NSCLC).
