TI  - Endoscopic ultrasound in the diagnosis of mediastinal diseases.
PG  - 560-565
LID - 10.1515/med-2015-0095 [doi]
AB  - EUS is a useful tool for diagnosis of mediastinal diseases. EUS-FNA plays an 
      important role in staging of lung cancer and in tissue acquisition in patients 
      with mediastinal masses. In this review, the following issues will be addressed: 
      EUS-FNA and EBUS-TBNA, metastatic mediastinal lymph nodes diagnosed by EUS, EUS 
      in assessment of mediastinal lymph node status for staging of lung cancer, 
      mediastinal lymphoma diagnosed by EUS, sarcoidosis and tuberculosis diagnosed by 
      EUS.
